        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Enterprise Architects (Data)/Data Office maintain the data reference architecture and standards: data modeling standards, naming/quality standards (links to VS-29/VS-28.2), integration data contracts (W3579), retention/archival (links to VS-88), privacy-by-design (links to VS-91), and the BI/analytics consumption pattern (links to VS-28.1)
Responsible (R): Enterprise Architects (Data) / Data Office
Accountable (A): Chief Enterprise Architect
Duration: Maintained</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3581_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3581_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3581_Task6" name="Enterprise Architects (Data)/Data Office review data implications of each…">
