Responsible (R): Enterprise Architects (Data) / Data Office
Accountable (A): Chief Enterprise Architect
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3581_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3581_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
