      <bpmn:userTask id="W3582_Task4" name="Enterprise Architects (Infra)/IT Operations define the cloud and infrastructure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Enterprise Architects (Infra)/IT Operations define the cloud and infrastructure architecture and strategy: cloud model (the ERP is cloud per model-company §14.1), multi-tenancy, region/availability zones, hybrid/edge (POS offline capability links to VS-08/W535/W539), networking/CDN, compute/storage/database services, and the FinOps/TCO model (links to VS-99.3/W3588)
Responsible (R): Enterprise Architects (Infra) / IT Ops
Accountable (A): Chief Enterprise Architect
Duration: Strategy + maintained</bpmn:documentation>
