Frequency: Maintained + per initiative
Volume: Enterprise security architecture
Owner: Enterprise Architects (Security) / IT Security Manager
Participants: Enterprise Architects (Security), IT Security Manager/Cybersecurity (links to VS-27.3), Data Privacy (links to VS-91), IT Operations (links to VS-27.1), ITAM (links to VS-99), PMO (links to VS-112), Audit (links to VS-21)
Source: workflow W3583 — Security Architecture</bpmn:documentation>
